  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s aperture it looks like a fossilised carp, grey throughout, lying in the primeval sea with very realistic fish scales.",
        "chapters": [
          127
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It also carries a stonefish appearance deep in that sea.",
        "chapters": [
          159
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The finished worm is rank two, the advance of rank one Stealth Rock Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          121
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It stays rank two even set against rank three Thunderwings Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          165
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_thunderwings_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In Fang Yuan’s aperture it looks like a fossilised carp, grey throughout, with realistic fish scales in the primeval sea.",
        "chapters": [
          127
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It also has a stonefish appearance deep in that sea.",
        "chapters": [
          159
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Stealth Rock Gu only hides the body, so clothes and gear stay visible. Stealth Scales Gu conceals the clothes as well.",
        "chapters": [
          121
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When activated, the body flickers like water ripples and vanishes on the spot.",
        "chapters": [
          127
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Against lightning wolves it is especially useful: their eyesight is sharp, but their smell is weak, so the Gu is their bane.",
        "chapters": [
          127
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It still fails against a dog’s nose, and other Gu can pierce or bypass the cloak, including Lightning Eye Gu, Snake Communication Gu (heat), Beast Language Gu, and clairaudience Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          127
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_lightning_eye_gu",
          "gu_snake_communication_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Against rank three clan elders the hiding ability is not effective.",
        "chapters": [
          165
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It cannot run with Thunderwings Gu at the same time. Once rank three Thunderwings Gu is active, the rank two Stealth Scales Gu cannot hide the lightning wings.",
        "chapters": [
          165
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After refinement he vanishes among lightning wolf packs,",
        "chapters": [
          127
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "and he recovers primeval essence while staying hidden.",
        "chapters": [
          130
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The same early wolf-tide stretch shows him preparing to enter the rock crack secret cave again.",
        "chapters": [
          127
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He also uses it to carry a captive deerling to the rock door,",
        "chapters": [
          129
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "and later to vanish with Gu Yue Yao Le after knocking her out.",
        "chapters": [
          151
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_yao_le"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
